change_type: instructions   changelog: - Clarified required environment variables; now only `GUARDRAIL_CHAIN_ID`, `GUARDRAIL_RPC_URL`, and `GUARDRAIL_SIGNING_MODE` are mandatory. - Dashboard API key, signer endpoint, and signer auth token are now only mentioned as conditional/optional, not required for all usage. - Updated documentation for runtime configuration to distinguish requirements for different signing modes. - Minor wording, formatting, and security note improvements to improve clarity and reduce over-specification.

